==Description==
The '''Birds Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 13 of the premium track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|380}} or {{Robux|56}} ({{Robux|47}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|2,460}} or {{Robux|772}}  ({{Robux|650}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

The '''Birds Nametag''' has animated smoke, likely represent as clouds. Two flocks of white birds can be seen flying.

